# Development Harness
#
# The ONLY environment variable needed. Everything else is stored in the
# SQLite database and configured via CLI or web UI.
#
# Configure settings:  harness config set <key> <value>
# Store API keys:      harness config set-credential anthropic.api_key <key>
# See all settings:    harness config list
# Open web UI:         harness serve

DEVHARNESS_STORAGE_DIR=.devharness
